cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the exact GPUPAL release or commit. The contributor list and DOI will
  be finalized before v0.1.0; also cite upstream PDAL when appropriate.
type: software
title: GPUPAL
version: 0.1.0-dev
abstract: >-
  GPUPAL (GPU Pointcloud Abstraction Library) provides a PDAL-compatible
  command that conservatively selects exact CPU and CUDA point-cloud
  processing implementations using measured end-to-end performance.
repository-code: https://github.com/zymazza/GPUPAL
license: BSD-3-Clause
authors:
  - name: GPUPAL contributors
keywords:
  - point clouds
  - PDAL
  - CUDA
  - lidar
  - geospatial
references:
